# Profile Update API Tests
# Make sure to register/login first to get a JWT token

### Update Profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "aboutMe": "I'm a software developer who loves hiking and photography.",
  "gender": "male",
  "status": "active",
  "relationshipStatus": "single",
  "ethnicity": "caucasian",
  "religion": "none"
}

### Update Bio Data
PUT http://localhost:8080/me/bio
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hobbyIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "interestIds": [1, 4, 7],
  "musicGenreIds": [2, 5],
  "movieGenreIds": [1, 3, 6],
  "foodPreferenceIds": [2, 4],
  "travelTypeIds": [1, 3],
  "languageIds": [1, 2]
}

### Update Preferences
PUT http://localhost:8080/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minAge": 25,
  "maxAge": 35,
  "genderPreference": "female",
  "maxDistanceKm": 50,
  "hobbiesWeight": 8,
  "interestsWeight": 9,
  "musicWeight": 6,
  "moviesWeight": 5,
  "foodWeight": 4,
  "travelWeight": 7,
  "languagesWeight": 8,
  "ethnicityWeight": 3,
  "religionWeight": 2
}

### Get Profile (to verify updates)
GET http://localhost:8080/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Bio (to verify updates)
GET http://localhost:8080/me/bio
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
